{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":20.16},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.28,"end":33.28},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.88,"end":44.8}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.56,"text":"RGB 通道範圍是 0 到 255。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.2,"end":6,"text":"工具匯出 CSS rgb(r,"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.24,"end":6.32,"text":"g,"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.62,"end":6.72,"text":"b)；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.84,"end":14.56,"text":"十六進位 CSS 則是每個通道用兩位十六進位數字表示的另一種寫法。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":15.44,"end":17.92,"text":"三個通道相同會得到中性灰，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":18.24,"end":20.16,"text":"不同則帶有色偏。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":21.28,"end":23.36,"text":"把所有通道设為 128，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.84,"end":25.28,"text":"檢查匯出的色碼。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":26.08,"end":27.92,"text":"接著只提高藍色，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":28.32,"end":30.24,"text":"比較色票和通道值。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":31.68,"end":33.28,"text":"哪個設定是中性灰？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":34.88,"end":36.72,"text":"哪個設定是中性灰？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.84,"end":41.52,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":42.32,"end":44.8,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}